window.products.push({"id":229120,"name":"Best Essential Oil Diffuser for Aromatherapy, With FREE A-Z PDF of Essential Oils and Their Uses, Adjustable Mist Mode w/ Auto Shut Off, Rotating Colo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DI2ktALPL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","description":"\"This is the best of 4 diffusers I've owned\" \"A++++++ QUALITY PRODUCT!!!\" HELPS YOU AND YOUR KIDS SLEEP LIKE A BABY. GREAT NIGHTLIGHT. NO NOISE WITH TINY FOOTPRINT. - Using the right essential oils like lavender and roman chamomile together can give you better sleep at night and can also help overcome insomnia.  - If you or your children like soft nightlights then you have a choice with 7 different colors you can control and turn off at will.  - The noise level is like a pin dropping on carpet. This Aroma Diffuser is just what you are looking for. HELPS YOU BREATHE BETTER. EFFECTIVELY SPREADS SCENTS AROUND WHERE YOUR MOMENTS ARE. - We seem to stay very mobile. We’re always going here and there in the house or on the road. Take the Scents you love with you wherever you want in the house, or on the road.  - It will help you breathe easier and help provide great smelling scents that give your moments more pleasure.  - Choose between auto or manual for 8 hr. low mist or 4 hr. high mist. Your Essential Oil Diffuser, mobility at its best! YOUR ESSENTIAL OIL DIFFUSER COMES WITH A 6 MONTH GUARANTEE! - If the performance of this Essential Oil Diffuser becomes Defective within those 6 Months , we offer full refund no questions asked.  - This aromatherapy diffuser is made from tough PP ABS materials to keep from breaking and cracking to ensure longevity.  - Be sure to DOWNLOAD THE PDF IN YOUR CONFIRMATION EMAIL as it includes a whole list of essential oils with info on each, plus it also has links on the bottom that take you to pages where you can purchase many of these oils. BREATHE FRESH - LIVE BETTER - Grab this Essential Oil Diffuser and TRY this 100% RISK FREE by clicking on the Orange Button on the TOP RIGHT CORNER NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DI2ktALPL._AC_SL1334_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilkan","source_asin":"B01EO74EK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EO74EK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EO74EK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
