window.products.push({"id":229177,"name":"Tavenly Will You Be My Maid of Honor Proposal Box With Lids - Cute & Elegant Floral Print - Gift Ideas for Brides Tribe Invitations - Empty Personaliz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712tYn1NhjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POP THE QUESTION BEAUTIFULLY: Time to propose to your maid of honor? Tavenly \"Will You Be My Maid of Honor\" gift boxes with attached lids are the perfect way to ask your bridal party to be part of your big day! Fill the kit box and pop the question using our stylish and elegant bridesmaid and made of honor proposal boxes. JUST ADD BRIDESMAID GIFTS: Each of our spacious maid of honor gifts from the bride measures 10 1/2 x 10 1/4 x 3 - which makes them easy to pack with anything you like or put bridesmaids favorites inside. Each box will easily fit small-size champagne bottles, makeup accessories, greeting cards, and beauty essentials. Our packaging oozes love, elegance, and sentiment without any hassle. SIMPLE SETUP: Asking someone to be your bridesmaid in the most creative ways! Pull the flat box up in one motion, and your gift box proposals are set up! Included in this set are one maid of honor box and four bridesmaid boxes. Our packaging can easily be disassembled and flattened for easy storage and is fully reusable and recyclable. SOPHISTICATED ELEGANCE DESIGNS: Gold foil details on the front with a simple motif of leaves on the boxes will fit every bridal theme. To add to the memorable wedding party event, you could embellish the gift boxes with metallic wire-edged ribbon, gift twine, or decoupage paper! Try decorating them with specific ink stamps or stencils on a pretty design for the bridal party or shower. THANK YOU GIFT IDEAS: Thank your tribe to be in advance! An empty box allows you to meet any budget while letting your imagination run wild. The options are endless, from face masks, lip gloss, jewelry, bath bombs, or a simple hair tie to a favorite drink or treats. No matter what you choose to include, you will love filling the boxes made for your proposal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712tYn1NhjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tavenly","source_asin":"B08X7JBRKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X7JBRKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X7JBRKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
