window.products.push({"id":229211,"name":"Triplett Coat of Arms, Crest & History 11x17 Print - Name Meaning, Genealogy, Family Tree Aid, Ancestry, Ancestors, Namesakes - Surname Origin: Englis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719MK5ecgpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The images used are EXAMPLES of what the product(s) will look like. This COLLECTIBLE product is a 11x17 print. The Surname for this product is the first word(s) in the products title and the country of origin is indicated with the last three words in the product title. This print uses the earliest coat of arms associated with a bearer of the surname (last name) and the time tested surname etymology, a history of the name and its origins throughout the ages. If available, it includes the ancient origin of the name, spelling variations, early movement of the surname during the Middle Ages, noteworthy bearers from around 1400AD or earlier up to current day, and first settlers in North America. There may be different variations of Coat of Arms for each surname and the one we use is the oldest registered Coat of Arms verified in history. History of Heraldry: Heraldry, in its broad meaning, traditionally had to do with the functions of a herald. Heraldry arose almost spontaneously in Medieval Europe around the 12th Century, coinciding with the development of armor, and the time of the crusades. This resulted in distinctive insignia's being painted on the knight's shield and embroidered on his surcoat, which was the only means by which the warrior could be identified. The Perfect Gift: These prints look great framed and/or with matting! This product ships directly from the manufacturer so please contact us with any questions you may have prior to your purchase as changes after purchase are not possible. Can't find your name? Contact us along with the name you are interested in purchasing. Due to the nature of this product returns or exchanges are only granted if the product was damaged in transit. Make sure to check out the variations abailable as well! The larger print offers more historical information then the smaller print.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719MK5ecgpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr Sweets","source_asin":"B08CNMRBWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CNMRBWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CNMRBWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
