window.products.push({"id":229270,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler - SEEPER 3-IN-1 Portable Air Conditioner for Room, 1-Second Cooling Tower Fan w/ 20FT Remote & 12H Smart Timer, 1Gal Water Tank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K9esZHfBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆【3 FUNCTIONS IN ONE: FAN/HUMIDIFIER/COOLER】SEEPER Evaporative Air Cooler adopts an advanced evaporative cooling system that integrates 3 functions, fan/humidification/cooling. In addition to being used as a tower fan, it can also be further cooled by adding water/ice cubes to lower the temperature and at the same time humidify the air in the hot and dry summer. SEEPER portable air conditioner brings coolness in the hot summer, is your best choice! ❆【1-SECOND RAPID & CUSTOMIZED COOLING】This portable evaporative cooler can provide personalized cooling for different scenes and temperatures. It has 3 modes and 3 wind speeds to adjust freely, Normal/Natural/Sleep mode & Low/Medium/High speed. When you are sleeping, you can turn on the sleep mode, save energy and bring you a comfortable natural breeze. The SEEPER cooling tower fan can fully meet your different needs this summer. ❆【ENERGY SAVING & ECO-FRIENDLY】The evaporative cooling system of this freestanding air cooler conveys natural and cool air, lower the indoor temperature effectively. Compared with other cooling units, while ensuring the cooling effect, the power of this evaporative window cooler is lower (only 60W), which can save electricity costs and is more environmentally friendly. Enjoy professional comfortable air with SEEPER! ❆【12-HOUR SMART TIMER FOR SWEET DREAM】Do you often have trouble sweating while sleeping during summer nights? SEEPER water cooler air conditioner helps you solve this problem. With a 12-hour timer, you can choose a suitable running time according to your sleep time, and the power supply will be automatically stopped to help save energy. At the same time, the running sound does not exceed 51 decibels, which guarantees you a cool and quiet sleep! ❆【SPACE SAVING & EASY MOBILITY】This evaporative cooler has a compact design, size 8.5*9.6*23.3 inch, which helps save space. Moreover, 360° casters and handles, with a weight of 8.7 lbs, make it very convenient to be moved to the position you want to use at will. You will find that easily rolling into your desk. The SEEPER floor air cooler is perfect for every area in the home/office/backyard/garage/gym, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K9esZHfBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEEPER","source_asin":"B09N6YPSHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N6YPSHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N6YPSHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229271,"name":"ApexDesk SK Series Ergonomic Leather High-Back Office Chair Adjustable Seat Height, Backrest and Armrest – Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lHmKFZcmL._AC_.jpg","description":"All day sitting in the office, you’ll need a chair that’s got your back. The ApexDesk SK Series Office Chair is full on adjustment options – Seat height is adjustable from 17. 5 inches to 20. 5 inches. Headrest tilts up to 45 degrees, adjustable up to 3 inches high. Backrest allows for additional lumbar support with a twist on the side knobs. Armrest can be pulled up/down up to 3. 5 inches, slide front to back up to 3 inches and even twists sideways +/- 30 degrees. Tired from work? You can now stretch and lean back on the chair without worrying about tipping over. The unique PVC “S” shaped structure on the backrest curls up to provide added back support while you lean over. You can even increase/decrease tilt tension on the backrest via a twist knob on the underside of the seat. All these options translate to maximum posture and comfort for your body while maintaining a seated position. Experience how the SK Series Adjustable Office Chair transforms the way you seat!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lHmKFZcmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ApexDesk","source_asin":"B0742MTPYD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0742MTPYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0742MTPYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
