window.products.push({"id":229286,"name":"Premium Reusable Storage Bags Set of 9 | Reusable Freezer Bag | MORE DURABLE with BORDER 0.4\" | 3 Snack Bags + 3 Reusable Lunch Ziplock Bags For Kids ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61msY-Q6YIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say goodbye to plastic baggies. Say hello to reusable ziplock bags! Having a leaky sandwich in your lunch bag is the worst, but with our durable and leak-proof bags, you can say goodbye to that gross soggy bread. Plus, these bags are perfect for storing anything from leftovers to crafts supplies. We have a variety of sizes so there’s always one just right for the job at hand. WHY US? Convenient & Durable: - Leakproof: Upgraded airtight seal closure provides leakproof.- Easy Seal: with the upgraded wide side & non-slip zipper design, easy to open & close.- Freezer Safe: designed to prevent freezer burn while preserving the original flavor of food.- Convenient: transparent design gives you a clear view of the contents while keeping multiple items together. Multi-Purpose - Marinate: Bags can marinate steak, chicken, salmon, fish, meat, etc. - Freezer storage: Store leftovers and keep seafood, fruits and vegetables fresh. - Home Organization: Storage bags storing makeup, first aid kits, desk supplies, hardware, toys, and travel accessories. Great for Our Planet & Family - Reusable: 1 reusable bag can save up to 400 + disposable bags, don’t feel bad again for throwing out disposable bags. - 100% Food Safe: Made of food-grade PEVA, the storage bags are ideal for packing your and your kid's lunches on the go. Package Includes - 3 x Extra Large Freezer Bags (8 ¼” x 9 ⅛”) - 3 x Large Sandwich Bags (7 5/16” x 8 ¾”) -3 x Small Reusable Snack Bags (5 11/16” x 9”)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61msY-Q6YIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aforcli","source_asin":"B07ZSW6VX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZSW6VX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZSW6VX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
