window.products.push({"id":229439,"name":"Top Guy Mugs Grandpa Coffee Mugs, 1 Count (Pack of 1), Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QLJRjEFJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We all know that the men in our lives can be notoriously hard to buy for well no more, as Top Guy Mugs are here to solve your gift dilemmas. Giving the gift of humor over his morning cup of joe, choose our funny coffee mugs for dads, uncles, brothers or sons who like to start their day with a smile. This Top Guy Mug is specially designed for a Grandpa – the personalized coffee tumbler is printed with an arrow and THIS IS WHAT AN AWESOME GRANDPA LOOKS LIKE. The lightweight, enamel camping mugs have retro styling and a practical design that’s perfect for home or the office, but the versatile men’s enamel mug is just as suitable as a fishing, boating, RV or camping coffee cup for men who love outdoor adventures. With bold, masculine colors on the outside, the interior of the carbon steel coffee cup is white, and the rim is metallic. Each of our coffee mugs for guys has a large, strong handle and holds 14oz of liquid – that’s plenty of tea, coffee or even beer – and the indoor or outdoor enamel mug is sure to become their favorite tea or coffee tumbler. Practical and versatile, Top Guys Mugs are the perfect gift for the man who has everything – except a personalized coffee mug","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QLJRjEFJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Top Guy Mugs","source_asin":"B07DB1NYFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DB1NYFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DB1NYFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229440,"name":"Homesick Scented Candle, 13.75 oz, South Carolina","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gY3gP0-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Founded in 2016, Homesick creates authentic, hand-poured products that draw on the power of scent to evoke treasured memories of people, places, and memories. Each fragrance is extensively researched and developed by our team of storytellers, perfume chemists, and chandlers in collaboration with passion communities. Made from a natural soy wax blend with premium cotton wicks and custom fragrance oils, our candles are non toxic, contain no lead, plastics, parabens or phthalates and are hand poured in small batches in Massachusetts. From the Manufacturer Bring home to you, no matter where you are Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. States, Cities, Countries and Memories Whether it’s the seabreezes of Southern California, the distinctive scents of spring days in Central Park in NYC or the vibrance of the energy that pulses through Brasil we have you covered. Books Scent: The main theme is an older leather bound book accord mixed with a woody desk character of cedar and sandalwood. Hints of balsamic and vanilla finish the complex scent. Grandmas Kitchen Table Scent: The scents of rich butter mixed with touches of apple, cinnamon, clove and a hint of sugar cookie. Tonka bean and sugar finish out this homey aroma. Summer Camp Scent: Fresh green grass accord with hints of crystal clear lake water, blooming hyacinth found along trails and just a touch of fresh lemon and smoke. Take Me Home Scent is the strongest tie to memory. Inhaling those sweet aromas while your mind immediately travesl back to those carefree days or amazing experienes. Home can mean so many things and it can be in so many places. Homesick Candles allows you bring bring all of those memories with you, no matter where you go! From your childhood state, to the city where you got engaged, to the best vacation ever in Hawaii to that epic Road Trip with your friends. We have a custom scent for all US States, iconic cities, vibrant countries and those memorable experiences. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Nostalgic, Memories, All-Natural How did you come up with the idea for this product? We were living in NYC and yet all of us were from somewhere else and missing home. In the winter of 2016, we sought out to find a way to keep that place with you, no matter where you live. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. keep that place with you, no matter where you live. What makes your product special? We finely craft custom scents that are tied to places and memories. Nostalgia in the warmth of a candle. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Collaborating with other small businesses and local input. We feel like we've taken a road trip thru the entire USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gY3gP0-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homesick","source_asin":"B06XG55H1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XG55H1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XG55H1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
