window.products.push({"id":229573,"name":"Submersible LED RGB Puck Light 4 Pack - 14 LEDs Per Puck W/Remote Control Great for Weddings & Special Events","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kfDO5InoL.jpg","description":"These are NEW high quality, very bright reusable battery powered REMOTE CONTROLLED Floralyte LED lights that produce great effects in or out of water. These new remote controlled submersible Floralytes are amazing with 14 very bright Multi-colored LED lights. The 14 LED's can be controlled to output 13 different colors with shades of RED, GREEN, BLUE, YELLOW, ORANGE and WHITE (White is not pure White as it's a mixture of the RGB LED's) as examples. They can remain in one color or there is a choice of changing between colors by using the FADE button (slow change from one color to another) or JUMP function (fast switch from one color to another) all of which is achieved via the Remote Controller. All LED's change color at the same time. These lights are great for all your special events such as Weddings, Parties, BBQs, Christenings, Halloween, Christmas and much more! Use at different events where a different color scheme is required or change the display part way through the event. No need to get your hands wet or disturb the display as they are all controlled by remote controller. Instructions: 1) Unscrew the two halves of the light and fit 3 x AAA batteries (not included). 2) Screw the two halves of the Floralyte tightly together again to ensure waterproof seal. 3) Remove the battery keep fresh tab to activate the remote control unit. 4) Place the light in the required position and press the remote control ON button to turn the light ON and the OFF button to turn the light OFF. 5) Use the remote controller to select the choice of color or function required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kfDO5InoL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wiedamark","source_asin":"B00AFXKW7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AFXKW7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AFXKW7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
