window.products.push({"id":229583,"name":"SKÖN lifestyle - Missy 15X/1X Personal Compact Mirror - Powerful 15X Magnification and Traditional 1X Mirror, Full 180 Degree Opening, Effortless Magn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lIV5n3OhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"SKÖN lifestyle introduces Missy - 15X/1X Magnification in Metallic Gold. Who is Missy? Missy is fun, chic and causal. Missy is always willing to hangout and wants to be seen with you. Missy should be your new best friend. Stature: Missy is small and lightweight. Missy has a hard exterior but is very fragile on the inside. Missy is best described as a square; Missy’s measurements are 3.25x3.25 inches. Style: Missy is very versatile; she can be casual, trendy chic or cosmopolitan glamour. Missy can be seen in classic white or black, but can also be seen sporting the current trendy colors. Most prized possessions: Missy has two square 2.75x2.75 inch optical, distortion-free glass mirrors; one mirror is a traditional 1X magnification, while the other is a 15X magnification. Personality traits: Missy is a true friend because she will never lie to you. When you need her, Missy will always offer you her two points of views. Missy will tell you exactly how things are, meaning there is no sugar coating. But if you move closer, Missy will whisper little secrets about yourself. Missy will tell you things about yourself that you may not have noticed before. Don’t worry, your secrets are safe with Missy.   Are you ready to hang out with Missy?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lIV5n3OhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKÖN lifestyle","source_asin":"B01F0G1N22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F0G1N22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F0G1N22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
