window.products.push({"id":229657,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler - AGILLY 2-In-1 32-Inch Portable Air Conditioner & Cooling Fan with 80°Wide Oscillation, 4 Modes, 2 Ice Packs, Remote Control, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iKOAVrE2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【NOT JUST A FAN & MORE THAN AN A/C】Unlike traditional air conditioner that use compressors and refrigerants, and typical tower fan that blow room-temperature wind, Agilly air cooler constructs with 3 central components: a fan, a pump system, and a honeycomb-shaped evaporative cooling media to cool, humidify, and circulate chill air to stand up to summer heat. By adding ice or cold water into 1.3 GALLON water tank, you can easily enjoy extra coolness in seconds. ❄️【4 MODES & 3 WIND SPEEDS, MADE THE COOL BREEZE 】Agilly evaporative air cooler features with 4 pre-programmed modes (Normal/Nature/Sleep/Cold) & 3 wind speeds(Low/Medium/High). You could mimic the comfort of a cool lake breeze with Nature mode and blow powerful wind after jogging at High Speed. Total 12 combinations of airflow to cool your Summer.What's more, 80° OSCILLATION design helps cool small to medium enclosed rooms up to 400 sq.ft, bedroom, garage, basement, as needed. ❄️【REMOTE CONTROL PORTABLE DESIGN】12-Hour Timer feature and remote control amplify freedom. Just a click to control your fan from 20ft, making it possible that enjoy a gentle outdoor wind in your own living room while you are reading or enjoying the recent series without having to get up from the couch. Also, there is an automatic shutdown in 1-12 hours intervals or just use the remote. The gliding wheels and built-in handle is designed for easy movement. ❄️【40dB HIGH-INTENSITY MUTE 】The portable air conditioner's ultra-quiet performance makes you sleep like a baby after a long day of work. This tower fan only produces rhythmic 40dB noise, relaxing as listening to rainfalls in the tropical forest. It is not upsetting. The airflow sounds like a beautiful lullaby that may help you fall asleep quickly. ❄️【ENERGY SAVING& ECO PROTECTION 】Compared with your costly AC, AGILLY Cooler is more environmentally friendly and safe for your health. This personal cooler combines 3 energy-efficient functions for all of your cooling & ventilation needs with cool, fan, & humidifying modes all in one unit. Set for evaporative cooling or a more gentle fan-only breeze during warm summer, and use as a humidifier to keep air hydrated during the dry season.Only costs you less than 30 cents for a whole day cooling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iKOAVrE2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AGILLY","source_asin":"B08RRYQQZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RRYQQZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RRYQQZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
