window.products.push({"id":229669,"name":"Arkwright LLC Aston & Arden Oversized Beach Towel - 100% Ring Spun Cotton, 600 GSM Soft Quick Dry Bath Bulk Towels Perfect for Hotel Pool and Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815VcPcBDfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY TOWELS REDEFINED: Made from 30Double 100% ring spun cotton, Aston & Arden beach & pool towels are one of the most absorbent, softest, and heaviest towels on Amazon. This 600GSM luxury beach towel possesses a unique pinstripe design featuring complementary color configurations. OVERSIZED BATH TOWELS: Wrap yourself in luxury. These oversized bath towels measure 35 x 70 inches. Aston & Arden resort towels provide ample drying coverage. Place on a lounge chair or directly on the beach for a plush barrier between you and the elements. THICK POOL TOWELS COLORS: Aston & Arden large towels come in classic pinstripe designs. The evergreen color varieties will remain vibrant and chic - Blue/Green, Green/Blue, Green/Navy, Navy/Red, Navy/Yellow, Yellow/Navy. Buy complementary colored beach towel patterns like Blue/Green and Green/Blue to turn heads at the pool. MULTIPURPOSE CABANA TOWEL: Aston & Arden striped cabana beach towel make terrific home bath towels, hotel pool towels, resort beach towels, Premium Airbnb bed and breakfast bath towels, Luxury VRBO pool vacation rentals, or hotel spa towels. Use at the gym to cover workout benches with two layers of plush towel. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Always wash new towels before use as some lint may be generated after the first wash. Machine Wash with like colors. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Care for your beach towels properly, and your Extra large beach towels will look new and fresh even after multiples washes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815VcPcBDfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BMDFZTM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMDFZTM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMDFZTM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229670,"name":"Degrees Of Comfort Heated Mattress Pad Full Size | Zone Heating Electric Bed Warmer W/Auto Shut Off | Fit Up to 15 Inch | 12.5ft Long Cord - 54x75 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rYBBZR05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECTLY PLACED PLUG WON’T POKE YOU AT NIGHT: 12.5FT POWER CORD gives you plenty of reach to any nearby outlet, allowing you to place our pad on top mattress without fear of not reaching a wall outlet. YOU ALSO WON’T EVEN FEEL IT’S THERE because of our plump stuffed padding. The conveniently placed 6ft single controller cords can easily be reached and tucked away as well. PROTECT SKIN FROM BURNS & RADIATION: MOST COMPETITORS DON’T MENTION how harmful amounts of electromagnetic radiation can be transmitted through the heating process in most heated bed warmers. NOT IN OURS. AT Degree of Comfort, we engineered our heated mattress pads to heat up with barely any EMF radiation being dispensed. Also, our mattress pads are 100% UL SAFETY CERTIFIED. HEAT ONE SIDE & STAY COOL THE OTHER: BOTH SPOUSES CAN CUSTOMIZE their side of the bed’s temperature! 2 Individual Dual controllers (queen, king, cal king sizes only) give each person the power to choose their own heating preference. Allowing you to be QUICKLY HEATED FROM THE BOTTOM UP or quickly cool down as you wish. PREMIUM QUALITY FABRIC & 5 HEAT SETTINGS: The surface of electric mattress pad is made from soft and breathable polyester fabric, which makes you feel comfortable and enjoy a nice sleep. And waterproof heated mattresses can protect your beds from accidental spills. Besides, mattress pads with 5 heat settings design meet your different temperature demands for sleeping. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: 5 YEAR WARRANTY – WE KNOW YOU’RE TIRED OF buying inferior electric mattress pads that stop working in only the first few uses. That’s why we engineered our heated mattress pad to last all year round even through the most restless sleepers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rYBBZR05L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Degrees of Comfort","source_asin":"B07WC5QF7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WC5QF7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WC5QF7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229671,"name":"Emmylous Fruit and Vegetable Washing Machine Fruit Cleaner Device in Water IPX7 Produce Purifier with Wireless Charging & OH-ion Purification Technolo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xkDMLPFbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Deep Cleaning Technology】-Rinsing fruits and vegetables with tap water isn’t enough. Emmylous fruit and vegetable washing machine generates a large amount of hydroxyl radicals through electrolysis technology, which can combine with chlorine residues in food to remove 99% of chemicals while retaining the nutrients in food. ■𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐂𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐞:𝙀𝙢𝙢𝙮-𝙙𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙩■ 【Easy to use】-The fruit cleaner will automatically work when it touches water. You don't need to press any button to start it. The working time of veggie cleaner is 10 minutes. We recommend that you set the number of cycles based on the number of liters of water: ▶1-3 liters to choose 1 cycle, 4-6 liters to choose 2 cycles, 7 liters or more to choose 3 cycles.◀ You just need to take the vegetable cleaner out of the water and put it back, it will start a new cycle, there is no waiting time. 【Medical grade alloy electrolytic sheet】- With fast draining structure, you can drain it quickly after use, it is no need to worry. After frequent use of this purifier for fruit, the electrolytic particles will adhere to the electrolytic sheet, and the electrolytic efficiency will be slightly reduced, you can remove the top cover and rinse the electrolytic sheet directly with water to solve this problem, which can make your produce purifier cleaner.■𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐂𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐞:𝙀𝙢𝙢𝙮-𝙙𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙩■ 【Wireless Charging & IPX7 Waterproof】-This fruit washer uses wireless magnetic charging technology. After draining, you can charge it by simply placing it against the charging head. When the charge is complete, it is enough to work 20-25 times.(The charge takes only 100 minutes to finish from 0% to 100%.) It also has a reliable IPX7 waterproof rating, so you don't have to worry about leakage.■𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐂𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐞:𝙀𝙢𝙢𝙮-𝙙𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙩■ 【Safety and Service】-The produce fruit cleaner has no chemicals added, it will not damage the food nutrition. At the same time, the fruit and vegetable purifier makes the food last longer and preserve better.■𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐂𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐞:𝙀𝙢𝙢𝙮-𝙙𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙩■ 【A Surprise Gift】-Still struggling with what to give your family as a gift? There is no doubt that this vegetable washer is the best choice to meet your needs for purifying fruits and vegetables. It is better to act than to be impressed. Try it !!!■𝐎𝐧𝐥𝐲 𝐂𝐡𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐞:𝙀𝙢𝙢𝙮-𝙙𝙞𝙧𝙚𝙘𝙩■","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xkDMLPFbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emmylous","source_asin":"B0C2336LR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2336LR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2336LR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
