window.products.push({"id":229689,"name":"Malicosmile White Blue Dream Catcher Moon, Feather Dream Catchers for Bedroom Wall Decor Handmade Moon Decorations for Walls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rGOkkU3tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dreamcatcher was originated from the 18th century. Indians used it to capture the beautiful dreams and let the nightmares vanish with the appearance of the morning sunshine. They believed that the nights were filled with various dreams and only the dreamcatcher can filter the bad ones and bring them into sweet ones. 1. Product Information: *Style: Moon dream catcher with crystal pendant; *Material: Iron ring, leather cord, line, beads, feather, metal chain, etc; *Size: 7.8 inches (20cm) in large diameter, about 31.5 inch (80cm ) in length; *Color: Blue, white; 2. Product Features: ♥ The moon dream catcher is handmade. The net is woven by workers who own rich experience, only skilled workers can make such uniform and rhythmic grid; ♥ There is a delicate crystal pendant hanging in the middle of the moon-shape net, which is very pleasing to the eye with the overall style of the dream catcher; ♥ The white blue feathers are processed with multiple processes to ensure cleanliness and safety. They are well arranged with glossy beads and small rings make the dream catcher looks very elegant and comfortable; ♥ With beautiful design and symbols, the handcraft dreamcatcher is suitable for everyone's space decoration. Both adults and children will enjoy with it; ♥ The dream catcher hanging decor waves quietly in the air, it will not disturb you and it will pray for peace and good luck with you silently . 3. Product Application: ♥ The dream catcher is perfect to hang in bedroom, living room, window, on the wall, at the entrance, balcony, etc to decorate your house or anywhere you want; ♥ It is a great gift idea for your friends or families with best wishes and love to them. 4. Note: 1.The dream catcher is handmade, it is normal if there is a little difference between each one; 2.Avoid long-term exposure to the sun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rGOkkU3tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Malicosmile","source_asin":"B08NVYYY2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVYYY2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVYYY2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229690,"name":"puredown® Feather Down Comforter Queen, All Season Duvet Insert Light Grey Comforter, Hotel Collection Comforter Full Size(Light Grey, 88x88)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ix0Ct2mJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Microfiber Imported 🌛【HIGH DOWN CONTENT FILLING】 - This down comforter is filled with sufficient naturally breathable down and feather blend - 60% Down Fiber, 40% Feather Fiber, which is ethically sourced and Responsible Down Standard (RDS), OEKO-Tex Standard 100 certified, for all-natural comfort you can feel good about. Down has better insulation than other types of fillings. It keeps you warm without adding extra weight and bulk, the higher the down percentage, the warmer it will be. 🌼【ULTRA-SOFT FABRIC】- The down-proof peach skin microfiber cover combines softness and breathability, it is soothingly soft against your skin, and noiseless when moving, which will exceed your sleep expectations providing you with year-round enjoyment. - Simple but elegant design, fits the various types of decoration, with its Elegant Flowing Drape and Matte Sheen, this comforter adds more beauty, sense of luxury, and coziness to your bedroom. 🛌【ALL SEASON DOWN COMFORTER】 - It has advanced temperature-regulating ability providing suitable warmth and year-round comfort for most people and a wide range of climates. The duvet is available in King size: 104*88”, Full/Queen size: 88*88”, Twin size: 68*88”, and two colors: light grey, dark grey, which are more modern and also best at hiding stains, can be used as Duvet Insert or Stand-Alone Comforter. 📦【UNIQUE DESIGN】- 3D Baffle Box Construction is designed for maximum loft and consistent warmth. The baffle boxes keep the inner filling evenly distributed without any clumping or cold spots and trap more air, preventing heat loss, ensuring you a stable and long-lasting comfortable sleep. Corner Tabs help secure the comforter in place, prevent shifting. Superior double-needle stitch and piping avoid shedding, making the down comforter durable. 🌞【CARE INSTRUCTION】- Machine wash in gentle cycle with cold water, sun-dry or tumble dry on low when needed. It is usually unnecessary to clean a down comforter frequently, so as not to make the down filling less effective. Professionally clean your comforter only every few years. -The down comforter is packaged in a vacuum bag, it is recommended to spread it for a few hours and pat the comforter gently to fully expand or tumble in the dryer for 10 minutes at low temperature at first-time use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ix0Ct2mJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puredown","source_asin":"B07L1GW1W4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L1GW1W4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L1GW1W4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
