window.products.push({"id":229739,"name":"MARCUS HOME Improved Hair Dryer Holder, Hair Care Organizer with Waterproof Sticker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D9eVyi+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Notice: 1.Please apply on hard and flat surfaces or slightly rough surface with texture <0.5mm. 2. Please use within the weight capacity of 10 lbs. 3. Please avoid wallpaper/ rough/ loose painting/ unfinished wood surface. 4. Please avoid placing on gap or seam. 5. The adhesion is strong which might leave a mark on rough painting walls or wallpaper when removal. It works perfect on hard and flat surface such as tile, glass or even slightly rough surface with texture <0.5mm. Instruction: 1. Clean the wall from dust or oil. Keep the place dry and clean. 2. Peel off the protective cover and do not touch the adhesive base. Stick to the needed surface and squeeze the air out. 3. Make sure the basic contact completely for more than 6 hours. Then, install the metal part into fillister joint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D9eVyi+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARCUS HOME","source_asin":"B0739LMMDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0739LMMDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0739LMMDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229740,"name":"10 Pack Replacement Steam Mop Pads Compatible for PurSteam ThermaPro 10-in-1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GMDi7fOgS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Fit Model: 10 Pack Replacement Microfibre Steam Mop Pads for PurSteam ThermaPro 10-in-1. Features: 1. The cleaning mop pads are washable and reusable, so convenient by machine&hand washable.2. Microfiber material for effective cleaning, without fading in high temperature, strong water absorption.3. Have some extra mop pads on hand, you can replace a clean set for your ThermaPro 10-in-1 at once when your old mop pads get dirty.4.Replace these microfiber replacement pads frequently, make your home become more cleaner and comfortable. Package include: 10x Microfibre Steam Mop Pads. Installation method: 1: Card slot card tight mop pads.2: Install the mop pads along the drag head wrapping edge.3: Light pressure can be installed to complete. Service: 60-Day Warranty: 100% money-back or free replacement guarantee;If you have any questions about the product,please contact our customer service immediately to receive a full refund or new product. Kindly Note: The PurSteam brand name and logo are the registered trademark of the respective owner.Any use of the PurSteam brand name, model or part designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GMDi7fOgS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wagfall","source_asin":"B091SN5CKX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091SN5CKX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091SN5CKX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229741,"name":"Calphalon Simply Calphalon Stainless-Steel 2-Quart Chef's Pan with Lid, Collector's Edition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TF2TPAQSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Calphalon's chef's pans feature slightly rounded bottoms, giving them the appearance of saucepan/fry pan hybrids. To complete the package, they cook with the same versatility in mind, with the ability to create sauces and stir-frys with equal aplomb. The curved bottom of his 2-quart chef's pan makes it a natural for recipes that require whisking, and its wide top allows sauces to evaporate more efficiently during reduction. Simply Calphalon Stainless cookware takes many of the best attributes of Calphalon's renowned professional cookware and puts it into an affordable package. This chef's pan is designed with an eye toward simple elegance, with an 18/10 stainless-steel interior and exterior and a bottom core crafted from heavy-gauge aluminum. The three-ply construction ensures efficient heat conduction and quick cleanup, and is durable enough to withstand metal utensils. The wire loop handle stays relatively cool on the stovetop while also allowing you to hang the pot easily on a hook or peg. Calphalon makes it possible to monitor your foods while cooking with the pan's domed glass lid (with steel-reinforced rims). The pan is oven-safe to any temperature, though the cover is only safe to 450 degrees F. The unit is also dishwasher-safe and features a 10-year limited warranty. --Rivers Janssen From the Manufacturer Simply Calphalon makes choosing cookware a simple proposition. Everything that counts in cookware--delicious results, good looks, easy clean up, durability--is built right into it. Best of all, Simply Calphalon makes it easy to enjoy the simple pleasures of preparing and sharing great food at home. So what are you waiting for? Go home and cook! All-around solid construction and performance.Youll feel the difference--and the quality--the moment you pick up a Simply Calphalon pan. Simply Calphalon cookware is heavier than similarly priced cookware. That extra weight not only means greater durability; it also means improved performance. Inside every Simply Calphalon Stainless pan is a bottom core crafted from heavy-gauge, highly conductive aluminum. This uniformly thick core is critical to Simply Calphalons performance. It conducts heat evenly and efficiently--so foods cook evenly, too. Interior and exterior surfaces of Simply Calphalon Stainless are made from surgical quality 18/10 stainless steel. Theyre subtly brushed, to maintain their good looks through the years. And theyre non-reactive; so they wont change color or affect the taste of your food. Plus, most Simply Calphalon pans are oven and broiler safe, opening all kinds of options for creative cooking. Nonstick omelette pans and covers are oven-safe to 450 degrees. Sleek--and smart--styling Clean lines, sleek silhouettes and simple elegance are the essence of Calphalon style. Wheter your décor is traditional, retro or eclectic, the classic Calphalon look simply works! But at Calphalon, form alsways follows function. We design our pans to be hard-working as well as good-looking. Simply Calphalons contoured stainless steel long handles are individually sized for perfect balance and easy maneuverability with each pan. Helper handles on larger pans provide an extra measure of comfort and safety. All handles are double-riveted to stay right and tight fo rthe life of your cookware. Domed, tempered glass covers collect and return moisture to foods while they cook. And they make it easy to see houw your meal is progressing, too. Easy soap-and-water clean-up. Cooking doesnt have to be a lot of work. And with Simply Calphalon Stainless, neither does clean-up. Pans clean up easily with soap and water. In a hurry? You can even put them in the dishwasher. Simply Calphalon is protected by a ten-year warranty. Every inch and every aspect of Simply Calphalon is designed and tested to meet Calphalons strict quality standards. Simply Calphalon pans, handles, nonstick performance, and covers are covered by our 10-Year Warranty. Calphalon will repair or replace any item found defective in material or workmanship when put to normal household use and cared for according to instructions. Its as simple as that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TF2TPAQSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00008PC4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008PC4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008PC4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229742,"name":"Lorell Bookcase, 36\" x 12\" x 36\", Mahogany","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":190.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21MRAan5raL._AC_.jpg","description":"High-quality, veneer bookcase features a vintage square design. Solid, 3/4\" thick shelves are adjustable on 1-3/4\" centers with pinhole attachments, except for bottom shelf. Bookcase has a laminated finish on the back's interior and an unfinished back side. Each shelf holds up to 110 lb.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21MRAan5raL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lorell","source_asin":"B0006NIMZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006NIMZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006NIMZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229743,"name":"BATHWA 5-Tier Wire Shelving Unit on Wheels, Heavy Duty Rolling Shelving Rack, Chrome Shelves for Bathroom, Kitchen, Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Qtiieq2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ LARGE STORAGE SPACE: Measures - 59 x 35 x 183 cm/ 23.01 x 13.65 x 71.37 inch (L x W x H), the wire metal shelf can provide a lot of extra storage space without taking up too much space. Each tier of shelf can well load 100 lbs at the maximum. ★ DURABLE & STURDY: Made from strong powder-coated metal and high quality plastic clips, this 5 shelf storage rack is durable, stable and sturdy. Its sturdiness can well guarantee that it will not wobble after putting stuff on it. ★ MULTIPLE USAGE: This metal shelf is perfect for storing tools, clothes, books, and any other items that take up space in your home or office. Suitable for anywhere you need to create a tidy kitchen, create a minimalist living room, keep your bedroom clean, store your bathroom toiletries. ★ CONSIDERATE DESIGN: You can adjust the height of the storage shelf according to the size of your stored items, creating a custom unit that best suits your specific needs. Provide a side hook and 4 solid wheels (2 with locking brake) allow flexible movement while loaded. ★ ESAY SETUP: The assembly design is quite clever and uses no screws or bolts. Tips: The plastic clips need to be covered by the round cylinders on the corners of the shelves, until the cylinders covered the clips, it would get very sturdy and hold up very well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Qtiieq2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BATHWA","source_asin":"B0BG8FXGKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG8FXGKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG8FXGKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":229744,"name":"Gift Republic GR100002 Name a Rose Gift Box. Grow and Name Your Own Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ROQw9856L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The recipient of this gift will have a unique rose named after them and stored at the British library. An easy-to-use growing guide helps even the most novice gardener to plant their rose successfully. Once the seeds are planted, the recipient follows the simple rose naming instructions, providing us with their details and their chosen rose name. This information is then entered into the International Rose Naming Registry and is submitted to the British Library.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ROQw9856L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Republic","source_asin":"B0011E1PBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0011E1PBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0011E1PBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
