window.products.push({"id":229787,"name":"SMART-O R23 Oil Drain Plug M18x1.5mm - Engine Oil Pan Protection Bolt with Anti-Leak Technology, Anti-Vibration Function, Install Faster, Re-usable, E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BZ5Cu3rTL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"SMART-O® is the most advanced oil drain plug in the market, designed to offer a complete solution for the changing of oil dain plugs, prevents sudden and catastrophic oil loss, oil leaks, oil pan damage and ultimately engine damage. SMART-O® oil drain plug is designed to protect engines and the oil pan. In a different way than magnetic oil drain plugs, SMART-O® reduces wear on the oil pan thread and reduces risk for catastrophic oil loss which could damage the engine. Safe Seal Function Intelligent material O-Ring expands up to 10% - 20% when exposed to engine oil. This seals the oil pan from inside the thread rather than just from the outside. SMART-O® plugs provide powerful, safe sealing beyond any other oil drain plug system in the market. The use of SMART-O® plug prevents oil leaks and ultimately engine damage. Anti-Vibration O-Ring acts as an interference to prevent natural self-closing of plug, caused by engine vibration. O-Ring acts as an interference to prevent natural self-closing of plug, caused by engine vibration. This prevents SMART-O® from falling out due to vibration over time, if not tightened properly. This prevents SMART-O® from falling out due to vibration over time, if not tightened properly. This also prevents self-loosening through vibration, oil leaks and ultimately engine damage. This also prevents self-loosening through vibration, oil leaks and ultimately engine damage. *Tested by the Oakland University Fastening & Joining Institute and Spectrum Technologies, Michigan. Proven to resist excessive vibration forces. R23 Tech Specs: Thread Diameter x Pitch: M18 x 1.5 Thread Length: 11.7mm Hex Top: 19mmPlug Material: Low carbon steelPlug Finish: Black oxide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BZ5Cu3rTL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart-O","source_asin":"B00OZ6RZBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OZ6RZBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OZ6RZBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
