window.products.push({"id":229832,"name":"0rganic CocoSoy Unscented Tealight Candles Natural Coconut Soy Wax Botanical Candles 6 Hrs Long Burning for Relaxing and Aromatherapy, Bulk Candles Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WtG3RVgtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"p>Organic CocoSoy Tea Light Candles are the perfect choice for home decor, entertaining, and creating a relaxing mood. Our CocoSoy Tealights are made from high-quality NATURAL Coconut, Soy, and Palm plants and have a pure cotton wick braised specifically for unscented candles. The result is tea candles that burn cleanly, with a long and stable bright flame and no harmful-paraffin soot. Our Eco Tea Lights are versatile and available in a beautiful clear transparent jumbo size with 6 or 8 hours of burn time . Each candle is carefully shrink-wrapped and packaged in various biodegradable boxes: - Beautiful jumbo clear cups: 6 or 8 hours burn time: 48-Pack, 72-Pack, 96-Pack and 50-Pack, 100-Pack Alum Cup - Basic aluminum cups: 4 or 5 hours burn time: 50-Pack, 72-Pack, 100-Pack, 144-Pack 200-Pack and 300-Pack. Features: - Sustainable Coconut, Soy, and Palm Wax - Cotton natural fiber wicks by Atkin & Pearces, USA - No harmful paraffin soots ABOUT US: Eco Aroma Candles began as an innovative EcoLab applying Cornell's Plant Sciences and bringing to the market the best sustainable, eco-friendly EcoWax candles. Our objective is to replace millions of tons of harmful paraffin candles that releaseeveryday. We combine the molecular structures of natural Coconut Soy Palm, flowers and plants to create candles that burn efficiently and release pure fresh air with natural aromas. We invented a special distillation process that has enabled us to manufacture plant-based wax that is cheaper than the paraffin wax. By using CocoSoy Candles, consumers can save money and save the planet by eliminating millions of tons of harmful petroleum paraffin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WtG3RVgtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CocoSoy Candles","source_asin":"B09Q33ZR3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q33ZR3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q33ZR3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
