window.products.push({"id":229895,"name":"Semikolon Small Bound Linen Photo Album, Cream Pages, Sun Yellow (03001)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sZ4hVekoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Semikolon by Pierre Belvedere Small Bound Linen Photo Album is reflective of the traditional values of family and sharing, and representative of the company's belief that fine paper is ideal for expressing one's feelings and enhancing one's life. Semikolon, known throughout Europe for its exceptional bookbinding techniques, has spared no details in the construction of this lovely 8-1/4 x 6-1/4 x 1-1/2 inch album. The cover is fashioned from heavy book board and expertly dyed classic linen which is meticulously finished inside with mitered corners and thick, lightly ribbed cream watermarked paper. Consistent with Pierre Belvedere's 50-year tradition of creating fine stationery products, the book is filled with 40 sheets (80 pages) of acid free cream photo mounting board and has thick, lightly ribbed cream watermarked end pages. The pages are separated by glassine interleaving paper, all of which is bound into a classic spine. A handy photo CD pocket mounted on the inside of the back cover adds the finishing touch. The Semikolon by Pierre Belvedere Small Bound Linen Photo Album can be combined with Semikolon's coordinating Photo Albums, Scrapbooks and Classic A5 (6 x 8-1/2 inch) Books, also available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sZ4hVekoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Semikolon","source_asin":"B0087NUBAG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-229895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0087NUBAG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0087NUBAG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
